          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tamper-Evident Labels for the Medical & Pharmaceutical Industry",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_H6GwQB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NADCO® Tapes & Labels, LLC manufactures high-quality tapes and labels that can be printed with custom text and logos. One of our key product lines includes tamper-evident labels, which make it clear whether a product has been opened or compromised. Tamper-evident labels promote the safety and freshness of various products, especially in the food and beverage, medical, and pharmaceutical industries, where products that have been tampered with could be dangerous to consume.</p><p>A broken label notifies the consumer that the product has been tampered with and should not be consumed. Learn more about the applications and benefits of tamper-evident labels in the medical and pharmaceutical industries.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-inherit"
          }
        }
      },
