        "collapsible_item_j36Km7": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Common Applications of Tamper-Evident Labels for Medical and Pharmaceutical",
            "content": "<p>The following are some of the most common applications of tamper-evident labels in the medical and pharmaceutical industries:</p><ul><li>Medical durable goods</li><li>Medical documentation and packaging</li><li>Over-the-counter and prescription drug packaging</li><li>Barcode labels</li><li>Void seal labels</li><li>Destructible labels</li></ul>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": true,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_antcPw": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Key Benefits of Using Tamper-Evident Labels",
            "content": "<p>Tamper-evident labels have numerous advantages for both the manufacturer and the consumer. These are the main benefits of using these labels:</p><ul><li><strong>Improved product safety.</strong> Product safety is vital in the medical and pharmaceutical industries. Because they make it obvious if an attempt is made to remove them, tamper-evident labels reduce the risk of contamination and theft once the product leaves the manufacturer. </li><li><strong>Industry compliance. </strong>Many industries, including the medical and pharmaceutical fields, legally require tamper-evident labels on certain products. Using these labels helps you stay compliant with these policies.</li><li><strong>Better brand integrity.</strong> To establish your brand in the medical and pharmaceutical markets, it is important to win customers’ confidence. Tamper-evident labels make consumers feel safe when purchasing and using your products.</li></ul>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
