    "rich_text_F693bT": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_EGzPKr": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Tamper-Evident Labels From NADCO®",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_YQhKdA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Tamper-evident labels prevent minor to major incidents. While accidents cause most broken labels, some may be due to malicious intent. A broken tamper-evident label sends a direct warning to consumers that they should not use the product. Given how seriously consumers take tamper-evident labels, companies are beginning to use these labels even when not required by law. In doing so, businesses prioritize the needs of their customers.</p><p>If you are looking to partner with a leading custom label manufacturer, NADCO® Tapes & Labels, LLC is here to help. We specialize in tamper-evident label production and many other labels and adhesives. From our 35,000-square-foot warehouse, we keep a large inventory to ensure our customers can find exactly the products they need.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\">Contact us</a> today or <a href=\"/pages/request-a-quote\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Request a Quote\">request a quote</a> to start your custom order.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
