        "text_3kjzGf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Reducing lead times is elemental for a business to increase output and revenue. At NADCO, we strive to help you reduce lead times by providing a large warehouse to stock goods, accepting blanket orders, providing a large material portfolio, staying on top of changes in the supply chain and offering expedited services. <a href=\"https://info.nadco-inc.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">Contact us</a> to find out more.</p>",
